SUMMARY:Soul Awakening Holistic Healing Festival
DESCRIPTION:Soul Awakening Holistic Healing Festival Returns to Winters for Its Third Year\nA full day of wellness\, healing\, and community at Green River Brewing & Taproom \nWINTERS\, CA — May 2\, 2026 — The third annual Soul Awakening Holistic Healing Festival returns to Winters on Saturday\, May 2 from 10:00 AM to 4:00 PM at Green River Brewing & Taproom\, offering a full day of holistic healing experiences\, local vendors\, and community connection. \nProduced by Soul Garden Holistic Healing\, this free community event brings together practitioners and small businesses from across Northern California\, creating an accessible and welcoming space for people to explore wellness practices. \nGuests can experience yoga\, sound healing\, reiki\, somatic movement\, herbalism\, and more. The event also features approachable classes and demonstrations throughout the day. \nIn addition\, the festival will include Aztec dancers offering a land acknowledgment and blessing\, a traditional Maypole\, and hands-on activities like flower crown making and rock painting\, along with food and drinks. \nEvent Details:\nSaturday\, May 2\, 2026 | 10:00 AM – 4:00 PM\nGreen River Brewing & Taproom\, Winters\, CA\nFree Admission | $10 Parking\nhttps://www.soulawakeningevent.com/
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/soul-awakening-holistic-healing-festival/
LOCATION:Green River Brewing and Tap Room\, 4513 Putah Creek Road\, Winters\, CA\, 95694
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/SAHH-4.jpg
END:VEVENT
