SUMMARY:The Olive Oil Experience Box
DESCRIPTION:🫒🍷 The Olive Oil Experience Box at Great Bear Vineyards 🍷🫒\nSaturday\, May 2 | 12–5pm\nTicket Includes: Olive Oil\, Cheese Box & Glass of Wine\nMore than a meal… this is a flavor-filled tasting journey. ✨\nJoin us at the vineyard for a deliciously curated Olive Oil Experience Box\, where our handcrafted olive oil takes center stage—paired with a selection of sweet and savory bites designed to highlight just how magical great olive oil can be.\n🥖 Rustic bread for dipping\n🧀 Marin cheese\n🍑 Apricots & fresh strawberries\n🍯 Honey for a touch of sweetness\n🍰 And a perfectly indulgent olive oil cake to finish\nEach box is paired with a glass of wine\, making this the perfect way to relax\, picnic\, and savor the afternoon among the vines.\n🌿 Whether you’re a foodie\, a wine lover\, or just looking for a unique vineyard experience\, this is one you won’t want to miss.\n👉 Order in advance to avoid disappointment!\n💫 Wine Club members—don’t forget to log in for your exclusive discount at checkout.\nCome sip\, dip\, and savor with us!
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/the-olive-oil-experience-box/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards (Great Bear)\, 24800 County Rd 101A
