SUMMARY:Watercolor Class with Steve Ceccato
DESCRIPTION:Relax\, create\, and have fun in a welcoming watercolor class hosted by artist Steve Ceccato at his home in Davis. Open to all skill levels\, the class begins with essential watercolor techniques\, then invites you to paint something meaningful or beautiful to you — bring your own photo or choose from a variety of provided images including sunsets\, landscapes\, flowers\, and pets. Prefer to go abstract? Wonderful — abstract painting is always an option\, encouraging freedom\, experimentation\, and pure creative joy. \nNo experience necessary. Just bring yourself and a willingness to play! \nLocation: Steve Ceccato’s in Davis (address provided after registration)\nFee: $25 (includes all materials)\nQuestions: info@unityofdavis.org
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/watercolor-class-with-steve-ceccato/
CATEGORIES:Art
